> 5. Read the final artifact yourself and check it against EVERY criterion of the request, quoting counts from your own `read` output, and paste the checker's final coverage line verbatim.
> 6. Report: `done` only if every criterion is met (else `blocked` with the deviation and a recommended decision). Name the deliverable's path (the assistant copies it to /tmp/hirearchy-e4-s1-1792640562/deliverables) and pass `lessons`: 1-3 lines for the next request - what worked, what to change in this playbook, and the evidence (runs used, rework, review findings).
